WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.875
To sum up.

2
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:05.225
You checked the policy files, and failed
Learn's sample against the same rules.

3
00:00:05.225 --> 00:00:09.762
You planned against a fictional tenant,
created every policy report-only,

4
00:00:09.762 --> 00:00:12.663
and summarized the service
principal sign-ins.

5
00:00:12.663 --> 00:00:17.287
And you saw a ring enforced only with
the D N five decision, the allow-enforce

6
00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:21.762
switch and the reviewed summary, and
held again when the summary changed.

7
00:00:21.762 --> 00:00:27.221
The evidence an ISSO keeps is the scope
file, the pre-merge check, the findings,

8
00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:32.160
the plan and its requests, the sign-in
summary with the hash the D N five

9
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:37.012
record cites, the alert definition,
and each run's manifest, all dated.

10
00:00:37.012 --> 00:00:40.088
Before you ship, work through
the chapter's checklist.

11
00:00:40.088 --> 00:00:45.960
Next is Module 7: convert to managed
identities and federation, Gate 5.
